#. module: tt_mrp_backorder_traceability
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:tt_mrp_backorder_traceability.module_meta_information
msgid "Manufacturing Splits and Backorders Traceability"
msgstr "Traçabilité des fractionnements et reliquats de fabrication"

#. module: tt_mrp_backorder_traceability
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:tt_mrp_backorder_traceability.module_meta_information
msgid "Link, filter and group manufacturing orders with their splits and backorders"
msgstr ""
"Relier, filtrer et regrouper les ordres de fabrication avec leurs "
"fractionnements et reliquats"

#. module: tt_mrp_backorder_traceability
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:tt_mrp_backorder_traceability.field_mrp_production__tt_split_root_id
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tt_mrp_backorder_traceability.view_mrp_production_filter_split
msgid "Original MO"
msgstr "OF d'origine"

#. module: tt_mrp_backorder_traceability
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:tt_mrp_backorder_traceability.field_mrp_production__tt_split_root_id
msgid ""
"Manufacturing order this one originates from, at the root of the whole chain "
"of splits and backorders. It is set on the original order itself, so that "
"grouping by this field keeps the original order together with everything "
"derived from it. Empty when nothing was ever derived from the order."
msgstr ""
"Ordre de fabrication à l'origine de celui-ci, à la racine de toute la chaîne "
"de fractionnements et de reliquats. Il est également renseigné sur l'OF "
"d'origine lui-même, afin qu'un regroupement sur ce champ réunisse l'OF "
"d'origine et tout ce qui en découle. Vide tant que rien n'a été créé à partir "
"de cet OF."

#. module: tt_mrp_backorder_traceability
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:tt_mrp_backorder_traceability.field_mrp_production__tt_split_parent_id
msgid "Derived From"
msgstr "Issu de"

#. module: tt_mrp_backorder_traceability
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:tt_mrp_backorder_traceability.field_mrp_production__tt_split_parent_id
msgid ""
"Manufacturing order this one was directly derived from, by a split or as a "
"backorder. Empty on the original order."
msgstr ""
"Ordre de fabrication dont celui-ci provient directement, par fractionnement "
"ou en tant que reliquat. Vide sur l'OF d'origine."

#. module: tt_mrp_backorder_traceability
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:tt_mrp_backorder_traceability.field_mrp_production__tt_split_child_ids
msgid "Derived MOs"
msgstr "OF issus de celui-ci"

#. module: tt_mrp_backorder_traceability
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:tt_mrp_backorder_traceability.field_mrp_production__tt_split_origin
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tt_mrp_backorder_traceability.view_mrp_production_filter_split
msgid "Origin"
msgstr "Provenance"

#. module: tt_mrp_backorder_traceability
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:tt_mrp_backorder_traceability.field_mrp_production__tt_split_origin
msgid ""
"How this manufacturing order came to be:\n"
"- Original: the order the chain started from.\n"
"- Split: created by deliberately splitting a planned quantity.\n"
"- Backorder: created automatically for the quantity left to produce when an order was closed short.\n"
"- Undetermined: derived from another order before this module was installed, when the distinction can no longer be recovered."
msgstr ""
"Comment cet ordre de fabrication a été créé :\n"
"- Origine : l'OF par lequel la chaîne a commencé.\n"
"- Fractionnement : créé en divisant volontairement une quantité planifiée.\n"
"- Reliquat : créé automatiquement pour la quantité restant à produire lorsqu'un OF a été clôturé avant d'être terminé.\n"
"- Indéterminé : issu d'un autre OF avant l'installation du module, la distinction n'étant plus récupérable."

